      "username": "signoz-alertmanager"
    }
  },
  "_comment": "DEV PLACEHOLDER: api_url is a Slack incoming-webhook URL \u2014 replace all REPLACE_WITH_* segments from the secret store. Channel name must match preferredChannels in alerts/*.json."
